{"id":"perte","lemma":"perte","pos":"noun","rank":1211,"glosses":["loss","ruin; undoing"],"ipa":"/pɛʁt/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c4/Fr-perte.ogg/Fr-perte.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"pertes"},"formAudio":{"pertes":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6b/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-pertes.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Je suis désolé pour ta perte.","en":"I'm so sorry for your loss.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"être"},{"g":"sorry"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"your"},null]},{"text":"Quelles sont nos pertes ?","en":"What are our losses?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1102835","words":[{"g":"which","l":"quel"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"our","l":"notre"},null]},{"text":"C'est une grosse perte.","en":"That's a big loss.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"big, thick, fat","l":"gros"},null]},{"text":"Je dois couvrir sa perte.","en":"I have to cover his loss.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"must","l":"devoir"},{"g":"to cover up, to cover"},{"g":"his"},null]},{"text":"Ce fut une perte de temps.","en":"It was a waste of time.","words":[{"g":"this / it"},{"g":"bole","l":"fût"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"time"}]}]}